      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "PREPARE ONCE. Select either native H3 Image or Video VAE, load a character sheet or image, then Run. The file is saved in models/refpacks/. For more views, batch images with the stock Image Batch node before Encode Images; each batch image gets a separate Picture slot.\n\nFor an outfit, use a single outfit image and change name + filename to outfit / outfit.safetensors. For a replacement character use another filename, e.g. mai_concert.safetensors.\n\nThe VAE preparation is detected automatically. The resulting still-image pack works with both H3 Image and H3 Ref2VA. Filename collisions stop unless overwrite is enabled.\n\nRoles are numbered automatically within each role; there is no role ID field. Outfit and Location tags are aliases resolved to native picture slots before encoding. To use a location, prepare location.safetensors, enable its loader, and add at <Location 1> to the prompt.\nStill-image packs are shared across H3 Image and Ref2VA. Reuse the same character/outfit/location file; no target selection or second encode. Motion packs remain video-only."
      ]
    }
